{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2021-08-13 14:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN TO REOPEN PENNSYLVANIA INTERMODAL FACILITY', 'text': 'NORFOLK, VA., AUG. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN (NYSE: NSC)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED PLANS TO REOPEN ITS INTERMODAL FACILITY IN GREENCASTLE, PENNSYLVANIA, CREATING CAPACITY TO SUPPORT ECONOMIC GROWTH AND HELP EASE SUPPLY-CHAIN CONGESTION THAT HAS SLOWED THE FLOW OF COMMERCE ACROSS ALL MODES OF THE U.S. TRANSPORTATION SECTOR.'}